  "description": "YITAMOTOR special design, same as original equipment in fit, performance, and function. You can get this Factory style headlight from YITAMOTOR for much less.\nFitment\n1999-2002 Chevy Silverado 1500 / 2500\n2001-2002 Chevy Silverado 1500HD / 2500HD / 3500HD\n2000-2006 Chevy Suburban 1500 / 2500\n2000-2006 Chevy Tahoe (NOT FIT 2000 Chevrolet Tahoe Z71 Model)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle Compatibility - Headlight assembly compatible with 1999 2000 2001 2002 Chevy Silverado 1500/2500; 2001 2002 Chevy Silverado 1500HD, 2500HD, 3500; 2000 2001 2002 2003 2004 2005 2006 Chevy Suburban; and 2000 2001 2002 2003 2004 2005 2006 Chevy Tahoe (does not fit 2000 Tahoe Z71 model). Not compatible with GMC Sierra; high beam mode HB3/9005 and low beam mode HB4/9006. Note: Bulbs and wiring harness are NOT included. Please verify your vehicle's model and year before purchase\nWaterproof– Fully sealed with solid silicone and equipped with one-way pressure-equalizing vents, the housing prevents moisture buildup and condensation\nEnhanced Brightness – The metallic parabolic reflectors optimize light output, delivering a broader, smoother, and more focused beam. Experience enhanced nighttime visibility and reduced eye strain for safer driving\nSide Safety Reflector – Built-in micro-prism reflectors on the sides make your vehicle highly visible to oncoming traffic and pedestrians at night. This passive safety feature ensures you are seen from all angles, reducing collision risks\nDirect Replacement– Professional Installation would be highly recommended; come as a pair, including Driver (Left) & Passenger (Right) side",
